WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:04.001
Extract oscar-3.11.6.zip into a clean release directory and enter oscar-3.11.6.

2
00:00:04.041 --> 00:00:08.310
Run sudo bash oscar.sh init to configure hostname, admin credentials, and TLS.

3
00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:12.710
Verify all three OSCAR Compose services report running and healthy.
